APPLICATIONICONNAME ID 1000 "NIO Config"
FORM ID 1000 AT (0 0 160 160) USABLE
BEGIN
 TITLE "NIO Config"
 PUSHBUTTON "Springboard" ID 1001 AT (4 59 72 15) USABLE GROUP 1
 PUSHBUTTON "Serial" ID 1002 AT (78 59 36 15) USABLE GROUP 1
 PUSHBUTTON "USB" ID 1007 AT (116 59 40 15) USABLE GROUP 1
 BUTTON "Baud" ID 1003 AT (3 80 29 15) USABLE FRAME
 BUTTON "Flow" ID 1004 AT (34 80 27 15) USABLE FRAME
 BUTTON "Save" ID 1005 AT (63 80 29 15) USABLE FRAME
 BUTTON "Test" ID 1006 AT (94 80 27 15) USABLE FRAME
 BUTTON "Reset" ID 1008 AT (123 80 34 15) USABLE FRAME
END

ALERT ID 1001 CONFIRMATION
BEGIN
 TITLE "Reset transport state?"
 MESSAGE "End NIO apps first. Reset the serial/CS1 peer, or physically disconnect/reconnect USB to retire its old host owner. This clears local uncertainty; it cannot undo remote actions. Has the peer/link been reset?"
 BUTTONS "Cancel" "Reset"
END
